This is a modified copy of WhatsMiau.

Upstream: https://github.com/whatsmiau/whatsmiau (tag v1.7.0)
Fork:     https://github.com/albertobarcelos/whatsmiau
Branch:   feat/video-calls

Changes relative to upstream:
- 1:1 call API exposes H.264 Annex-B video (place/answer with video,
  WebSocket media, mid-call camera enable/upgrade) on top of the existing
  PCM audio bridge. Video is carried by meowcaller; this fork only wires it
  to HTTP/WebSocket the same way audio already is.

